        "b9fcfd4f10727d780635d3f6092b1d06a1a2e2a5"
      ],
      "title": "NTLMSSP: fix dissecting the spnego mechListMIC payload",
      "message": "NTLMSSP: fix dissecting the spnego mechListMIC payload\n\ndissect_ntlmssp() is also called from dissect_spnego_T_mechListMIC(),\nwe should detect a 16 byte structure starting with 0x01\nand use dissect_ntlmssp_verf().\n\nAll other messages in dissect_ntlmssp() start with the\nmagic string \"NTLMSSP\", so they never match the 0x01.\n\nIt fixes another problem seen in the example captures\nof https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/17958\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
      "author_name": "Stefan Metzmacher",
      "author_email": "metze@samba.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-02-23T20:47:56.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-02-24T08:53:17.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/af6d86d4a73f322b6963c1ad1e468b229da8592c"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9fcfd4f10727d780635d3f6092b1d06a1a2e2a5",
      "short_id": "b9fcfd4f",
      "created_at": "2022-02-24T08:53:17.000+00:00",
