        "ef31431aebf8a22a44bf5a97b576d108741c3e75"
      ],
      "title": "NTLMSSP: fix AUTHENTICATE_MESSAGE without NTLMSSP_NEGOTIATE_VERSION",
      "message": "NTLMSSP: fix AUTHENTICATE_MESSAGE without NTLMSSP_NEGOTIATE_VERSION\n\nIf we have data remaining before the start of the variable data,\nwe should assume the space for the version field even without\nthe NTLMSSP_NEGOTIATE_VERSION flag. In that case we should\nmark the 8 bytes as zero bytes.\n\nThis fixes https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/17958\n\nSigned-off-by: Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>\n",
      "author_name": "Stefan Metzmacher",
      "author_email": "metze@samba.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-02-23T20:45:12.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
